WEBVTT

01:31.330 --> 01:32.670
Hey.

01:32.670 --> 01:33.420
Sorry, I fell asleep while texting you yesterday-

01:33.420 --> 01:35.170
What does "like" even mean?
Sorry, I fell asleep while texting you yesterday-<b></b>

01:36.000 --> 01:43.380
This is just like the I don't hate her sort of "like," yeah?

01:43.540 --> 01:47.540
Not like I want to go out with her or anything, no way.

01:47.790 --> 01:51.880
Love and infatuation and all that is
just the brain bugging out, anyway.

01:52.250 --> 01:53.920
Like some sort of mental illness.

01:54.250 --> 01:58.790
The sort that leads plenty to ruin their lives.

01:55.880 --> 01:57.630
<b>Popular Member Involved in</b>

01:55.880 --> 01:57.630
<b>Unforgivable Affair</b>

01:55.880 --> 01:57.630
<b>Charming Actor Caught in</b>

01:55.880 --> 01:57.630
<b>Forbidden Overnight Stay</b>

01:55.880 --> 01:57.630
<b>Cheating Scum Gives</b>

01:55.880 --> 01:57.630
<b>Tearful Apology</b>

01:57.670 --> 01:59.170
<b>Caught Spending</b>

01:57.670 --> 01:59.170
<b>Night Together</b>

01:57.670 --> 01:59.170
<b>Affair News</b>

01:57.670 --> 01:59.170
<b>Popular Member Gives Teary Apology</b>

01:59.420 --> 02:02.130
I'd never allow myself to succumb to that.

02:02.500 --> 02:06.210
Chii wrote on it yesterday, so it's your turn today, Moeko.

02:06.210 --> 02:08.000
Wait, we're taking turns on this?

02:08.000 --> 02:08.420
Yup!

02:08.460 --> 02:10.420
<b>Mountain Farm Dairy</b>

02:08.460 --> 02:10.420
<b>Farm Fresh</b>

02:08.460 --> 02:10.420
<b>Milk</b>

02:23.330 --> 02:26.420
<b>Dangerous - Don't Touch!</b>

02:23.790 --> 02:25.750
Is she staring at Yamada?

02:26.460 --> 02:27.250
<b>Mountain Farm Dairy</b>

02:26.460 --> 02:27.250
<b>Farm Fresh</b>

02:26.460 --> 02:27.250
<b>Milk</b>

02:26.960 --> 02:31.670
Wait, is she trying to sneak that out of class?

02:32.040 --> 02:35.920
Is it to feed to abandoned dogs and cats
like some scene out of a manga?!

02:32.250 --> 02:37.250
<b>Take us home</b>

02:35.920 --> 02:38.000
Hey, Yamada, where's your milk?

02:38.040 --> 02:40.170
<b>Dangerous - Don't Touch!</b>

02:38.080 --> 02:39.290
I drank it already.

02:39.290 --> 02:40.080
That was fast!

02:40.210 --> 02:42.420
<b>Library</b>

02:40.420 --> 02:42.380
At least, I thought it might be...

02:42.460 --> 02:44.960
<b>Puruche</b>

02:43.210 --> 02:44.790
But it was just to make some Puruche.

02:46.790 --> 02:49.250
Come on though, again?

02:49.250 --> 02:52.210
Why does she always pick stuff she has to make herself?

02:52.210 --> 02:53.210
Save that stuff for home!

02:53.500 --> 02:56.330
Don't you need a bowl to make that stuff?

03:01.830 --> 03:04.040
S-shouldn't you be a little more careful?

03:04.960 --> 03:06.420
No bowls, no choice!

03:08.210 --> 03:10.080
Gotta be some in the home ec room, right?

03:10.170 --> 03:15.630
<b>Dangerous - Don't Touch!</b>

03:10.290 --> 03:12.170
Oh, you're right!

03:13.040 --> 03:15.420
Go fetch me one, then.

03:15.670 --> 03:16.210
<b>Library</b>

03:15.710 --> 03:17.580
Damn this girl!

03:17.880 --> 03:20.130
Wait! I'm just kidding!

03:20.670 --> 03:21.880
Let's go together.

03:32.130 --> 03:35.250
You sure do love stuff that's a pain to make, huh?

03:35.250 --> 03:36.790
Like that Nerunerunerune from last time.

03:37.040 --> 03:39.750
Yup! I'm on a bit of a cooking kick.

03:40.170 --> 03:41.250
"Cooking"?

03:41.630 --> 03:45.500
Does she think making Nerunerunerune
and Puruche count as cooking?!

03:45.790 --> 03:47.710
Oh, Yamada...

03:48.040 --> 03:49.710
<b>Home Economics Room</b>

03:51.290 --> 03:52.830
It's locked...

03:52.830 --> 03:53.790
Seems like...

03:56.460 --> 03:57.670
Now wait just a second!

03:57.960 --> 03:59.420
<b>Science Lab</b>

03:59.580 --> 04:01.130
The science lab, huh?

04:02.000 --> 04:03.630
There's someone in the room next door.

04:03.630 --> 04:04.420
Eh?

04:06.290 --> 04:08.460
Better keep quiet.

04:16.790 --> 04:17.540
Talk about obsessive!

04:17.540 --> 04:19.920
Shh! Measuring stuff out is key!

04:20.130 --> 04:21.380
Now then...

04:25.380 --> 04:26.380
Here.

04:28.670 --> 04:31.420
We better stay down low so we don't draw attention.

04:33.460 --> 04:36.170
What the heck sort of situation is this, even?

04:37.790 --> 04:38.790
All done!

04:39.040 --> 04:40.880
Shoot, we don't have any spoons.

04:40.880 --> 04:42.000
Give me your finger.

04:42.000 --> 04:42.540
Huh?

04:51.000 --> 04:51.790
Go on!

04:55.750 --> 04:56.830
How is it?

04:56.830 --> 04:58.880
It's... all right...

05:04.290 --> 05:06.380
This is all I get?

05:06.540 --> 05:07.830
What are you kids doing?

05:09.670 --> 05:13.500
Oh, we uhh, just forgot something here.

05:13.710 --> 05:15.040
Forgot what?

05:21.880 --> 05:23.830
T-that-'s just...

05:24.080 --> 05:25.670
It's Puruche!

05:25.960 --> 05:27.210
Ichikawa!

05:30.500 --> 05:33.670
Sure got an earful for that.

05:33.920 --> 05:35.380
Unbelievable...

05:35.710 --> 05:37.580
Hmm? Again?

05:46.630 --> 05:47.920
Hey, umm!

05:52.210 --> 05:54.420
I didn't realize the window was open...

05:54.420 --> 05:56.670
That's what you get for being a space-case.

05:57.630 --> 05:59.130
Come get it with me!

05:59.630 --> 06:01.630
Get it yourself!

06:03.580 --> 06:05.540
Rin, did you apologize?

06:07.080 --> 06:09.920
It wasn't like I meant to do it!

06:10.170 --> 06:13.250
Yeah, but you could at least say sorry.

06:13.250 --> 06:17.540
She might think you did it on
purpose if you don't say anything.

06:17.790 --> 06:19.290
Oh, give me a break.

06:19.710 --> 06:22.790
I never could stand these cat fights.

06:23.040 --> 06:26.540
You never used to be like this back in elementary school.

06:26.670 --> 06:27.630
<b>Daijuni Junior High</b>

06:26.670 --> 06:27.630
<b>Rin Kanaoya</b>

06:28.040 --> 06:30.290
You're the one who changed, Serina!

06:30.290 --> 06:32.420
You're so lame, hanging all over her!

06:32.710 --> 06:33.670
What?!

06:37.420 --> 06:41.000
Guess it must look like that to people
who don't really know Yamada.

06:42.330 --> 06:46.580
Yamada herself seems like she cares the least, though.

06:49.750 --> 06:51.130
What's Kanaoya doing here?

06:51.750 --> 06:53.420
Is she here to say sorry?

06:55.170 --> 06:57.170
Guess I better excuse myself and-

06:57.170 --> 06:58.080
Hey!

06:59.670 --> 07:01.170
Isn't this hilarious?

07:01.460 --> 07:04.330
I swapped faces with the poster behind me.

07:06.380 --> 07:08.290
Look at this one, too...

07:08.290 --> 07:11.750
I swapped faces with my dog.
Creepy, right?

07:13.920 --> 07:16.460
This is REALLY not the time...

07:19.420 --> 07:22.420
Shoot! I'm getting in the way, here.

07:22.830 --> 07:23.880
Say...

07:24.040 --> 07:26.830
<b>Dangerous - Don't Touch!</b>

07:24.710 --> 07:26.540
Wanna take one together?

07:28.420 --> 07:29.880
<b>Dangerous - Don't Touch!</b>

07:31.750 --> 07:34.420
No, I'm not into stuff like that.

07:36.710 --> 07:38.040
No, huh?

07:39.290 --> 07:40.750
Dammit all!

07:47.210 --> 07:48.880
Has she been watching this whole time?

07:59.420 --> 08:01.170
Hey, Kanaoya!

08:01.170 --> 08:02.460
You ever used this before?

08:02.460 --> 08:06.500
O-oh, Yamada. Didn't see you there.

08:06.880 --> 08:08.080
Ever used what?

08:08.210 --> 08:09.790
This face-swapping app.

08:10.040 --> 08:12.080
That was really big a while back, yeah.

08:12.080 --> 08:13.830
Well it's big with me right now!

08:14.170 --> 08:15.500
Wanna take one together?

08:15.790 --> 08:19.920
Sure, but you're just gonna be ugly swapping with me.

08:21.210 --> 08:22.630
Show some modesty...

08:23.040 --> 08:24.170
Ready?

08:25.830 --> 08:26.960
All done!

08:27.170 --> 08:29.420
Hey! What's with the weird face?

08:35.080 --> 08:41.420
Bet I could have made an even weirder
face if I hadn't hurt my nose.

08:45.330 --> 08:48.880
I'm sorry. I really am...

08:48.880 --> 08:50.500
Hmm? Why?

08:52.500 --> 08:53.960
Sorry for what?

08:54.420 --> 08:57.630
I'm the one who hit you with the ball.

08:58.210 --> 08:59.420
You were?!

08:59.630 --> 09:01.580
She didn't even know?!

09:02.540 --> 09:05.630
It's really no big deal!
I should be the one apologizing.

09:07.210 --> 09:08.750
Want some snacks?

09:08.750 --> 09:09.960
Ack, fresh out.

09:10.250 --> 09:12.500
Oh, I bet I have some candy!

09:18.630 --> 09:19.670
Sheesh...

09:19.670 --> 09:21.330
When did you get here?

09:21.330 --> 09:23.330
Would you get down here and help?

09:32.170 --> 09:33.000
See?

09:33.170 --> 09:37.000
See what? You're such an idiot.

09:37.460 --> 09:38.580
Yeah, well...

09:39.880 --> 09:41.630
I'm sorry, too.

09:41.630 --> 09:43.460
I got a little too worked up.

09:46.000 --> 09:49.290
"Hmm? Why? Sorry for what?"

09:49.290 --> 09:53.000
Acting like her doesn't make you any cuter, y'know.

09:53.170 --> 09:55.580
Oughta thank you too, Ichikawa.

09:55.580 --> 09:58.580
"Hmm? Why? Sorry for what?"

10:04.380 --> 10:07.130
People sure are worried about Yamada's nose, huh?

10:07.500 --> 10:11.000
Guess it only makes sense.

10:11.830 --> 10:13.420
She's a model, after all.

10:14.040 --> 10:16.830
Not that she seems to care one bit.

10:18.210 --> 10:19.670
Seriously, what's her deal?

10:20.130 --> 10:21.040
Oh!

10:25.080 --> 10:28.380
Wow, look at you with your new bike.

10:28.380 --> 10:29.670
Lucky you, eh?

10:29.880 --> 10:32.580
She sounds like she's about to mug me...

10:33.040 --> 10:34.380
Wanna give me a ride?

10:38.080 --> 10:41.000
Do I... Huh?

10:42.130 --> 10:43.960
T-to where?

10:44.040 --> 10:46.670
Wait, you will?

10:46.670 --> 10:48.830
Don't ask if you don't mean it!

10:49.210 --> 10:51.830
To Muraoka's snack shop, then.

10:51.830 --> 10:52.710
Where's that?

10:54.460 --> 10:57.330
Don't girls usually sit with their legs to the side?

10:57.710 --> 11:00.210
Almost forgot! Hang on.

11:01.380 --> 11:02.380
Papiko?

11:04.330 --> 11:07.040
I never would have dreamed in all my miserable life

11:07.040 --> 11:09.630
that I'd split a pack of
Papiko with a girl one day...

11:11.210 --> 11:12.040
Here!

11:13.460 --> 11:17.000
Right. Of course.
This is Yamada we're talking about.

11:19.290 --> 11:21.130
T-thanks...

11:23.210 --> 11:25.580
What the heck kind of reaction was she looking for?

11:28.670 --> 11:33.500
Isn't this whole riding together bit a little sudden, though?

11:33.880 --> 11:36.040
Don't you ever have club practice or anything?

11:36.040 --> 11:38.750
N-no, I'm just in data processing club.

11:39.170 --> 11:40.710
We only meet once a week.

11:40.710 --> 11:43.630
Sudden? Sudden for what, though?

11:44.130 --> 11:46.920
What am I even implying, here?!

11:48.080 --> 11:50.710
She's a lot lighter than I thought.

11:51.130 --> 11:52.170
Know what?

11:53.710 --> 11:55.670
I'm gonna quit basketball club.

11:56.380 --> 11:57.500
Yeah?

11:58.290 --> 12:03.830
I hadn't been to practice in a while anyway,
and now I'm forbidden from playing, so...

12:03.830 --> 12:06.670
Forbidden? Talk about harsh.

12:07.460 --> 12:10.630
But I gotta join some club, right?

12:11.000 --> 12:12.130
Yeah...

12:13.130 --> 12:15.290
Maybe I'll join the data processing club.

12:16.040 --> 12:17.420
Yeah?

12:21.460 --> 12:22.920
Say something, at least!

12:23.630 --> 12:25.830
I said "yeah," right?

12:28.920 --> 12:31.920
Are we still good?
Are we having an actual conversation?!

12:32.210 --> 12:34.460
A-am I still breathing?!

12:36.830 --> 12:38.290
<b>Haramachi Police</b>

12:38.540 --> 12:41.880
Double-riding a bicycle is a serious breach of the law!

12:41.880 --> 12:44.080
I'm going to contact your parents and your school.

12:44.210 --> 12:47.000
Kyotaro, how could you...?

12:47.210 --> 12:50.170
She was riding on that loner's bike?!

12:50.710 --> 12:53.880
I had to quit my modeling career...

12:54.790 --> 12:57.790
I'd never allow myself to do something like that!

12:58.130 --> 12:59.080
Uh, maybe-

12:59.080 --> 12:59.920
Hey.

13:00.710 --> 13:05.710
Do you prefer the standard coffee flavor
Papiko or the white sour ones?

13:05.710 --> 13:07.580
T-the coffee ones...

13:09.670 --> 13:11.920
Afraid of a little change, huh?

13:16.170 --> 13:17.380
The light's green.

13:20.540 --> 13:21.580
Right...

13:22.670 --> 13:24.790
I've always been sick.

13:29.460 --> 13:31.420
There's just something wrong with my head!

13:34.830 --> 13:35.670
Thanks.

13:35.670 --> 13:37.000
Bet I felt heavy.

13:37.000 --> 13:38.250
No. Not a bit.

13:38.830 --> 13:41.170
Guess I've got no choice but to give you this.

13:41.170 --> 13:43.880
Huh? Wait, what? Really?!

13:44.330 --> 13:46.040
You don't need to act THAT surprised.

13:48.920 --> 13:50.960
All right, here, then.

13:56.130 --> 13:57.170
Oh, you!

13:58.500 --> 14:00.750
Was that the right way to react?

14:01.500 --> 14:02.790
Bye-bye!

14:04.210 --> 14:06.330
Maybe I should raise my hand higher?

14:09.960 --> 14:12.670
<b>Year 2 Class 3</b>

14:10.210 --> 14:12.580
All right class, listen up.

14:12.880 --> 14:17.830
Apparently someone threw away some sort
of snack food wrapper in the library trash.

14:17.830 --> 14:22.580
Now, all of you know it's against
the rules to bring in snacks.

14:24.210 --> 14:27.790
Playing with your eraser is real third grader level stuff!

14:28.580 --> 14:33.790
If we're having this talk now after the
whole Puruche incident, then I bet...

14:34.130 --> 14:35.130
Yamada.

14:36.130 --> 14:37.750
Any idea who it could be?

14:37.920 --> 14:39.710
You should have been ready for this!

14:40.380 --> 14:43.460
I never threw anything in the trash, so it couldn't be me.

14:49.130 --> 14:52.380
Yamada, I want you in the teacher's office after class.

14:54.790 --> 14:56.500
Wait, why, though?

14:56.500 --> 14:58.460
What do you mean, "why"?
An idiot through and through, huh?<b></b>

14:58.460 --> 14:58.830
I really didn't throw it away.

14:58.830 --> 15:00.040
I really didn't throw it away.
This could be a problem, though.<b></b>

15:00.040 --> 15:01.710
Just give up already.
This could be a problem, though.<b></b>

15:01.710 --> 15:02.130
What?

15:02.130 --> 15:02.500
C'mon!

15:02.500 --> 15:03.130
Huh?

15:04.790 --> 15:09.080
Our teacher was busy,
so Yamada's off the hook until next week, now.

15:09.920 --> 15:15.500
But if she can't bring snacks in anymore,
that means she won't drop by the library...

15:15.500 --> 15:17.830
Blergh, I'm exhausted.

15:17.830 --> 15:19.500
I had to work five days in a row.

15:19.500 --> 15:21.170
And now I'm here babysitting.

15:21.420 --> 15:23.750
You're the one who dragged me out here.

15:24.380 --> 15:27.380
Thanks for coming with me, my darling little brother!

15:27.380 --> 15:28.170
Don't give me that!

15:29.830 --> 15:33.750
I wanted to use this time to think up a plan, too...

15:34.130 --> 15:38.880
If anyone from my class caught me
here with this idiot, I'd just die.

15:39.210 --> 15:41.750
Wait, stop thinking like that.

15:41.750 --> 15:42.630
Every time you do...

15:42.630 --> 15:43.880
Place is packed, huh?
Every time you do...<b></b>

15:43.880 --> 15:44.250
Place is packed, huh?

15:44.250 --> 15:45.000
Right?

15:45.380 --> 15:45.710
Oh, there's a table.

15:45.710 --> 15:46.960
Oh, there's a table.
It always comes true!<b></b>

15:46.960 --> 15:47.920
Oh, you're right.
It always comes true!<b></b>

15:51.460 --> 15:52.500
What's wrong?

15:52.500 --> 15:53.420
Enough of you!

15:53.540 --> 15:56.460
Gotta admit, I was surprised.

15:56.750 --> 15:59.040
Didn't think NO ONE would hit on us.

15:59.040 --> 16:00.130
Sorry.

16:00.130 --> 16:03.420
Do you ever actually get hit on out on the street?

16:03.580 --> 16:05.290
I kind of want to know the answer to that...

16:05.290 --> 16:06.540
Well...

16:06.710 --> 16:09.130
I've had someone come up and talk to me before.

16:09.250 --> 16:12.790
But it turned out to just be some relative of mine.

16:13.000 --> 16:14.540
I can't hear a word she's saying!

16:14.540 --> 16:16.670
Chill it with the seasoning pack!

16:16.670 --> 16:17.920
Kyo-chan.

16:18.790 --> 16:20.290
You sure that's enough?

16:20.290 --> 16:23.170
You look like some girl on a diet with just a salad!

16:24.380 --> 16:25.750
Shut your mouth, you idiot!

16:26.250 --> 16:30.960
Here, a present from your big sis.
You're still a growing boy!

16:32.420 --> 16:33.210
I'm...

16:34.040 --> 16:36.080
I'm gonna go buy something.

16:38.380 --> 16:39.710
Thank you for coming in.

16:39.920 --> 16:42.250
Whew, I needed to get out of there.

16:42.460 --> 16:45.750
Why do my worst nightmares always come true?

16:45.920 --> 16:46.920
Hey!

16:48.330 --> 16:49.830
W-wow...

16:50.080 --> 16:51.580
Watch it!

16:52.080 --> 16:54.500
Is she trying to pick a fight?

16:54.500 --> 16:56.420
Was that your sister there with you?

16:56.420 --> 16:57.750
She's super cute.

16:58.420 --> 17:01.330
She's always trying to do everything for me.
It's a pain.

17:01.330 --> 17:04.290
Yeah? I wish she was my friend!

17:04.790 --> 17:07.920
So she could do everything for you? Sheesh!

17:07.920 --> 17:11.130
Kinda jealous. I'm an only child.

17:11.130 --> 17:13.460
Yeah, I could have guessed.

17:13.880 --> 17:15.500
That's what everyone says!

17:19.380 --> 17:20.580
What are you getting?

17:20.580 --> 17:21.500
Seasoned chicken.

17:21.830 --> 17:23.710
Oh, copying me, huh?

17:24.040 --> 17:25.710
Busted, dude!

17:26.670 --> 17:29.460
She looks so grown up out of her uniform.

17:29.750 --> 17:31.960
Maybe I'll get something, too.

17:32.130 --> 17:32.750
Oh!

17:32.750 --> 17:34.460
I want some soft-serve!

17:35.170 --> 17:38.500
Shoot, I forgot my wallet upstairs.

17:38.500 --> 17:40.130
Were you not planning on getting something?

17:42.790 --> 17:43.880
I was going to the bathroom...

17:44.290 --> 17:46.130
The bathrooms are all upstairs.

17:47.460 --> 17:50.750
Whoopsie! Imagine that!

17:52.710 --> 17:53.580
See you later!

17:53.580 --> 17:54.960
Thanks for waiting.

17:55.130 --> 17:56.460
Sheesh...

17:58.080 --> 18:00.330
Wait, did she come down just to talk to me?!

18:00.330 --> 18:01.290
Are you ready to order?

18:02.130 --> 18:05.130
Oh, uhh... the seasoned chicken, and...

18:05.630 --> 18:07.880
No, why would she?

18:07.880 --> 18:10.880
I bet she really just didn't know
where the bathrooms were.

18:11.040 --> 18:12.080
Will that be all?

18:12.080 --> 18:14.500
No, uhh, and...

18:15.420 --> 18:17.670
What did I buy this for?

18:18.250 --> 18:20.080
It's not like I could ever give it to her.

18:22.960 --> 18:24.580
Oh, this is...

18:25.250 --> 18:27.830
Well well, copied me again, huh?

18:29.130 --> 18:30.750
Agh, no, I gotta-

18:32.960 --> 18:35.460
She smells so nice...

18:35.790 --> 18:38.250
<b>Teacher's Office</b>

18:38.920 --> 18:41.630
Yamada's still not here?

18:41.830 --> 18:44.040
Bet she completely forgot.

18:44.040 --> 18:44.960
Hey!

18:46.080 --> 18:49.130
Quit popping up like that!

18:49.500 --> 18:52.540
What's the matter?
Need to talk to a teacher or something?

18:52.540 --> 18:55.080
N-no, I was just passing by.

18:55.880 --> 18:57.630
Come in with me, then!

18:57.630 --> 18:58.920
W-why?

18:58.920 --> 19:00.040
'Cause I'm scared.

19:00.040 --> 19:02.670
That's got nothing to do with me.

19:03.000 --> 19:04.210
Are you sure?

19:04.960 --> 19:07.210
Okay, maybe not NOTHING...

19:10.540 --> 19:12.420
Ichikawa, what are you doing here?

19:12.420 --> 19:14.580
Just here to observe.

19:14.580 --> 19:16.920
And to keep things transparent, too.

19:16.920 --> 19:18.210
I see.

19:18.210 --> 19:21.380
To make sure I don't pull any dirty tricks, hmm?

19:21.380 --> 19:22.290
Huh...?

19:22.290 --> 19:23.750
Guess she can be smart sometimes-

19:25.380 --> 19:28.830
You know snacks aren't allowed at school.

19:28.830 --> 19:30.630
Who brought in any?

19:30.790 --> 19:31.750
Me?

19:32.000 --> 19:36.000
Listen, I already know about
the incident in the science lab.

19:36.000 --> 19:40.080
Miss Yamada never admitted to bringing in any snacks.

19:40.080 --> 19:41.960
Okay, what's this all about?

19:42.210 --> 19:46.790
You are trying to find out who
threw away that snack wrapper,

19:46.790 --> 19:50.040
and are asking whether it was Yamada or not.

19:50.330 --> 19:53.290
All Miss Yamada here did was say that she didn't do it.

19:54.330 --> 19:58.080
She only answered that way because
she IS bringing in snacks, though.

19:58.080 --> 20:02.210
Normally you'd just say so if you weren't.

20:02.210 --> 20:04.580
"Normally," yes.

20:04.880 --> 20:05.960
What?

20:06.540 --> 20:09.420
Normally someone would understand
what you were truly asking.

20:09.420 --> 20:12.330
But some people just reflexively
answer the question asked.

20:13.000 --> 20:16.710
Which group do you think Miss Yamada falls in?

20:17.750 --> 20:19.040
Still...

20:19.040 --> 20:22.920
Miss Yamada didn't throw the wrapper away,
and never said she brought any snacks in.

20:23.080 --> 20:24.250
And that's that.

20:24.630 --> 20:26.330
Bam! Got him.

20:26.880 --> 20:28.750
That's all I came to say. We'll be off, now.

20:29.670 --> 20:30.540
Ichikawa!

20:32.000 --> 20:33.460
No good, huh?

20:35.130 --> 20:38.170
I've never seen you talk this much before!

20:38.170 --> 20:40.170
Glad to see it!

20:40.170 --> 20:41.630
Gimme a break!

20:44.790 --> 20:48.250
Not sure I really liked your logic there, but thanks.

20:48.880 --> 20:51.080
It was just a bit of sophism.

20:53.750 --> 20:54.960
Lemme give you some candy.

20:55.500 --> 20:56.960
<b>Otokomomo</b>

20:55.670 --> 20:56.830
Which one do you want?

20:57.330 --> 20:59.500
Only one of those is even candy.

21:03.630 --> 21:06.040
This one, then.

21:09.710 --> 21:11.380
You're such a kid.

21:11.380 --> 21:12.380
What?!

21:13.960 --> 21:15.330
Oh, and...

21:15.420 --> 21:16.460
<b>I</b>

21:17.460 --> 21:19.170
Let's talk more like friends, yeah?

21:19.460 --> 21:20.920
<b>Have a Problem</b>

21:24.380 --> 21:29.710
N-not like how we talk is a big deal, or anything!

21:29.960 --> 21:33.920
<b>I Have a Problem</b>
